; ==============================================================================
; ＠ト書き▼議論シーン9-8 死体を浮かせた方法
; 議論開始エフェクト
; BGM変更：HirO（Voなし）
@PlayBgm BgmPath:Bgm_37_1_Loop IntroBgmPath:Bgm_37_1_Intro Volume:1 Loop:true FadeInDuration:0

# Judge9-8-1

@Gosub Path:System/System_Subroutine.BeginDebate-First
@Gosub Path:System/System_Subroutine.BeginDebate-Effect
@Gosub Path:System/System_Subroutine.BeginDebate-Last
@ChangeTrialPauseMode Enable:false ProcessTimer:true

@HidePerspectiveStageScreen Index:1 Reset:true

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Angry1,ArmR2,ArmL2
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Hanna Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:我、<br>我可是<br>在雪莉搭电梯<br>上来之后，<br>就一直在那里<br>和她一起等着了哇！|#0204Trial08_Hanna001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Default,ArmR17,ArmL1,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Normal_Open04,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Normal_Middle
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Sherry Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:确实如此！<br>汉娜当时根本<br>没有机会进入电梯！|#0204Trial08_Sherry001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Miria.Default,ArmR3,ArmL8,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Glare_Open04,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Normal_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Miria Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:大叔我到达<br>上层的时候，<br>小娜已经在那里了，<br>说是小娜用魔法让尸体飘浮，<br>感觉有点牵强了……|#0204Trial08_Miria001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Angry1,ArmR2,ArmL2
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Hanna Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"没错！<br>我只能让<br><link=\"Objection_02_04_08_01\">自己的身体</link><br>飘浮起来呀！<br>要说是我让艾玛飘浮起来，<br>那是不可能的哇！|#0204Trial08_Hanna002|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

; ＠備考◆心情補足・表に出さない程度に庇おうとしている

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Default,ArmR2,ArmL2,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Normal_Open03,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Surprised_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Sherry Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:……假设<br>希罗说的<br>【用魔法让尸体飘浮】<br>是正确的……|#0204Trial08_Sherry002| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Default,ArmR2,ArmL2,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Normal_Open03,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Surprised_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Sherry Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:那除了汉娜之外，<br>会不会还有其他人<br>也能做到<br>让尸体飘浮呢？|#0204Trial08_Sherry003| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Default,ArmR2,ArmL2,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Normal_Open03,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Surprised_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Sherry Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:比如说亚里沙<br>制作了什么<br>类似热气球的东西。<br>这也是一种可能。|#0204Trial08_Sherry004| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Default,ArmR2,ArmL2,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Angry_Open02
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Alisa Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:如果真是我干的，<br>那所谓的【类似热气球的东西】<br>现在又在哪里？|#0204Trial08_Alisa001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Default,ArmR2,ArmL2,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Normal_Open03,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Surprised_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Sherry Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"那是因为有什么机关<br>可以回收热气球吧。<br>说不定还有<br><link=\"Objection_02_04_08_02\">隐藏通道</link>之类的，<br>亚里沙就躲在那里，<br>这也有可能。|#0204Trial08_Sherry005|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Default,ArmR2,ArmL2,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Normal_Open03,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Surprised_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Sherry Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:而且亚里沙你<br>也没有不在场证明吧？|#0204Trial08_Sherry006| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Default,ArmR2,ArmL2,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Angry_Open02
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Alisa Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:……啧。<br>要发挥想像力<br>想怎么说就怎么说的话，<br>谁不会啊？|#0204Trial08_Alisa002| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,47 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Default,ArmR2,ArmL2,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Angry_Open02
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Alisa Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"那我也可以说<br>【你用手当扇子扇风飞上天了】，<br>或者【其实并没有所谓的魔法，<br>靠的是<link=\"Objection_02_04_08_03\">念动力</link>】之类的啊？|#0204Trial08_Alisa003|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:35,38 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Default,ArmR17,ArmL12,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Normal_Open04,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Normal_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Sherry Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"又来了～！<br>我再怎么力气大，<br>我<link=\"Objection_02_04_08_04\">人也不可能飞起来</link>的啦～！<br>|#0204Trial08_Sherry007|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Default,ArmR13,ArmL4,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Smile_Closed01,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Normal_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Sherry Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:亚里沙，<br>讲话前要好好想清楚，<br>不可以乱说话哦！<br>哼！|#0204Trial08_Sherry008| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

; ＠備考◆ピキピキ…と怒り

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Default,ArmR2,ArmL7,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Angry_Open02
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Alisa Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:……你这家伙……！！|#0204Trial08_Alisa004| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4


